[Slow] 手話の拍手は、両手を上げて、ひらひらさせます。佳子さまも、手話の拍手を送りました。

35
00:04:30,807 --> 00:04:38,295
[Host] In sign language, you applaud by raising both hands and waving them. Princess Kako applauded this way too.

36
