56
00:07:12,648 --> 00:07:28,175
[Host] That's all for today. A speech does not always need a voice. This weekend in Tokyo, ten students spoke with their hands — and the whole hall answered them with waving hands instead of clapping. See you next time on Japanese Daily News.

